{"id":"17d2f06d43a19f1e","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-re-proj.md","title":"c.e. 集合的投影正规形","display":"thm-re-proj — c.e. 集合的投影正规形","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-re-proj","aliases":["20-thm-re-proj"],"display":"thm-re-proj — c.e. 集合的投影正规形","chapter":"2","section":"2.1","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Theorem 2.1.3","source_pdf_pages":[60],"source_printed_pages":[24],"depends_on":["[[20-df-re]]","[[20-df-recursive]]","[[20-df-pairing]]","[[20-df-stages]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-re-proj"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-re-proj</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-re-proj — c.e. 集合的投影正规形"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 2.1.3"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>60</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>24</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" href=\"?note=d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" title=\"20-df-recursive\">20-df-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" href=\"?note=d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" title=\"20-df-recursive\">20-df-recursive</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a>。</p>\n<p>上标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{tot}\">\\(\\mathrm{tot}\\)</span> 表示全定义限制：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\">\\(\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\\)</span>；相对族采用同一限制。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}re\\text{-}proj}\\vdash\nA\\in\\mathcal E\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists R\\subseteq\\omega^2\\\n[\\chi_R\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\land\\forall x\\ (x\\in A\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists y\\ R(x,y))].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}re\\text{-}proj}\\vdash\nA\\in\\mathcal E\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists R\\subseteq\\omega^2\\\n[\\chi_R\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\land\\forall x\\ (x\\in A\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists y\\ R(x,y))].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=W_e\">\\(A=W_e\\)</span>，用阶段模拟编码停止见证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(s,z)\">\\((s,z)\\)</span>。反向搜索 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R(x,y)\">\\(R(x,y)\\)</span> 成立的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span>，找到时停机。矩阵是统一可计算的二元关系，修复旧稿直接把一元可计算集合族当成二元关系的类型混淆。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 2.1.3；印刷页 24；PDF 第 60 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"d6dc5974baa6f8a5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-pairing]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-stages]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-recursive]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-df-stages]